# The four questions that delete something or send something (Remove contact, Announce myself, Stop the service, Delete
# conversation) and what a key does in them (QA of 0.3.0, F4: Left then Enter used to ANNOUNCE). The focus starts on Cancel
# and both buttons show a focus ring: Enter alone cancels, Left then Enter cancels (the arrows stop at the ends), Right
# moves to the main button (the ring moves with it), Tab and Shift-Tab go round and stay in the question, a letter does
# nothing, Esc cancels. Nothing is confirmed here: the checks fail the run if a request that deletes, stops or announces
# reaches the bridge.
# fake-scenario: chat
# forbid-verbs: contacts.remove, messages.delete_conversation, announce, service.stop, iface.remove
title Reticulum: the questions, by keys
sizes 640x480 480x320 800x480 480x800 480x640

wait 1500

# ---- Remove contact (Home > Contacts > Anna > Remove contact)
key down
key enter
wait 600
key enter
wait 500
key end
key enter
wait 400
shot remove-ring-cancel
expect text "Remove Anna?"
key enter
wait 300
expect notext "Remove Anna?"
key enter
wait 300
key left
key enter
wait 300
expect notext "Remove Anna?"
key enter
wait 300
key right
wait 200
shot remove-ring-main
expect text "Remove Anna?"
key left
key enter
wait 300
expect notext "Remove Anna?"
key enter
wait 300
key tab
wait 200
shot remove-tab
key tab
key enter
wait 300
expect notext "Remove Anna?"
key enter
wait 300
key x
key y
wait 200
expect text "Remove Anna?"
key esc
wait 300
expect notext "Remove Anna?"
expect text "Remove contact"
key esc
wait 300
key esc
wait 300

# ---- Announce myself (Home > Contacts > My address > Announce myself)
key home
key down
key enter
wait 600
key end
key enter
wait 600
key end
key enter
wait 400
shot announce-ring-cancel
expect text "Announce myself?"
key enter
wait 300
expect notext "Announce myself?"
key enter
wait 300
key left
key enter
wait 300
expect notext "Announce myself?"
key enter
wait 300
key right
wait 200
shot announce-ring-main
key tab
key enter
wait 300
expect notext "Announce myself?"
key esc
wait 300
key esc
wait 300

# ---- Stop the service (Home > Settings, the last row of the list)
key end
key enter
wait 600
key down
key down
key down
key down
key enter
wait 400
shot stop-ring-cancel
expect text "Stop the service?"
key enter
wait 300
expect notext "Stop the service?"
key enter
wait 300
key left
key enter
wait 300
expect notext "Stop the service?"
key enter
wait 300
key esc
wait 300
expect notext "Stop the service?"
expect text "Stop the service"
key esc
wait 300

# ---- Delete conversation (Home > Messages > Anna > More)
key home
key enter
wait 600
key enter
wait 900
key right
wait 600
key end
key enter
wait 400
shot delete-ring-cancel
expect text "Delete conversation?"
key enter
wait 300
expect notext "Delete conversation?"
key enter
wait 300
key left
key enter
wait 300
expect notext "Delete conversation?"
key enter
wait 300
key right
wait 200
shot delete-ring-main
key left
key esc
wait 300
expect notext "Delete conversation?"
expect text "Delete conversation"
key esc
wait 300
key esc
wait 300
key esc
wait 300
key esc
expect quit
